  "body": "Some homes impress with their size. Others win you over with their warmth, character and the simple pleasure of being somewhere you love to come home to.\r\n\r\nElevated above Orewa, 59B West Hoe Heights enjoys a beautiful coastal outlook, with views across the township towards Orewa Beach and the blue waters beyond. With warm timber interiors, generous outdoor living and a peaceful setting, this inviting home offers a relaxed lifestyle where everyday moments feel a little more special.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the living room welcomes you with natural timber finishes and the comforting warmth of a wood-burning fireplace. A charming window seat frames the coastal outlook, creating the perfect place to enjoy a morning coffee, read a book or simply watch the world go by.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen connects naturally with the adjoining dining space, while a versatile second living area can be enclosed by glazed French doors. Whether used as a family retreat, home office or entertainment room, it offers the flexibility to suit different lifestyles. Three bedrooms, a family bathroom, separate toilet and dedicated laundry complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nOutside, the wraparound deck extends the living experience, with its north-facing side opening towards the Orewa coastline. Long summer lunches, afternoon conversations and evenings spent watching the changing colours over the water. This is a place to slow down and appreciate the beauty of coastal living.\r\n\r\nA second, more private north-facing deck offers another peaceful outdoor retreat, while the easy-care garden, raised vegetable beds and garden shed provide space for those who enjoy a little gardening without the demands of extensive grounds. A workshop beneath the home provides a practical space for hobbies, projects or extra storage.\r\n\r\nJust a short drive from Orewa Beach, local cafés, restaurants, shops and coastal walkways, the location brings together the tranquility of elevated residential living with the convenience of a vibrant seaside community. With easy access to motorway connections, the wider Auckland region is comfortably within reach.\r\n\r\nWarm, welcoming and full of coastal character, 59B West Hoe Heights is a place to settle in, slow down and enjoy the simple pleasures of life by the sea.",
